    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong>Jungle Defenders is an online co-op survivors-like for 1-4 players.\u00a0Choose your hero from the animal kingdom each with unique abilities and battle through waves of mechanical enemies in chaotic and challenging arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></u><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the survivors-like bullet hell genre with multiplayer! Team up with your friends, synergize your skills to create powerful combos, and complete map objectives to take on epic bosses <strong>TOGETHER!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong></strong></u><br><u><strong>BULLET HELL/HEAVEN IN THIRD-PERSON COMBAT!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you love bullet hell games and third-person action combat, you\u2019re going to love this twist!</strong> Each hero features a unique, fun, and versatile spell kit designed to reward  skilled players and enable high-level gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BREAK THE GAME!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, with randomized upgrades, enemy types, and evolving strategies. Use sharp reflexes, clever builds, and wild instincts to survive and reclaim the forest. As you progress through the game, you'll unlock various Artifacts and power-ups to help you delve deeper and deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>JOIN OUR DISCORD! </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have anything to share with us like bugs, feedback, ideas, or suggestions to improve the game then don\u2019t be shy! We\u2019re excited to hear from you and stay tuned for our latest updates and content! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong>Jungle Defenders is an online co-op survivors-like for 1-4 players.\u00a0Choose your hero from the animal kingdom each with unique abilities and battle through waves of mechanical enemies in chaotic and challenging arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/dc85249f1d8c9f61f46917fbdff828f0.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></u><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the survivors-like bullet hell genre with multiplayer! Team up with your friends, synergize your skills to create powerful combos, and complete map objectives to take on epic bosses <strong>TOGETHER!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/8f14ea4c3dba0d31cd8f95ae92e08910.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong></strong></u><br><u><strong>BULLET HELL/HEAVEN IN THIRD-PERSON COMBAT!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you love bullet hell games and third-person action combat, you\u2019re going to love this twist!</strong> Each hero features a unique, fun, and versatile spell kit designed to reward  skilled players and enable high-level gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/e693ec823abdf868311beaed04b806dd.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BREAK THE GAME!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, with randomized upgrades, enemy types, and evolving strategies. Use sharp reflexes, clever builds, and wild instincts to survive and reclaim the forest. As you progress through the game, you'll unlock various Artifacts and power-ups to help you delve deeper and deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.poster.avif?t=1751315275\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.webm?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758070/extras/846e2c3d1200e8abb2bd342742a41f2d.mp4?t=1751315275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>JOIN OUR DISCORD! </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have anything to share with us like bugs, feedback, ideas, or suggestions to improve the game then don\u2019t be shy! We\u2019re excited to hear from you and stay tuned for our latest updates and content! </p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready for a wild third-person action journey where nature strikes back! In this explosive roguelike bullet hell, you play as fearless animals sworn to protect their forest from a relentless technological threat: invading robots set on exploiting natural resources and destroying the environment.",
